# Full-feature version of ../gitlab-simple.trace: the same nodes, links and labels, written with Trace's layout features. Not part of the held-out measure.
title "GitLab, simplified components"
direction down

pill SSH [terminal]: SSH
pill HTTP [globe]: HTTP/HTTPS
GitLabShell [square-terminal]: GitLab Shell
NGINX [nginx]: NGINX
GitLabWorkhorse [gitlab]: GitLab Workhorse
GitLabPages [file-code]: GitLab Pages
Puma [rubyonrails]: Puma (Gitlab Rails)
Sidekiq [rubyonrails]: Sidekiq (GitLab Rails)
store Gitaly [git-branch]: Gitaly
store PostgreSQL [postgresql]: PostgreSQL
store Redis [redis join]: Redis

HTTP -> NGINX : TCP 80,443
SSH -> GitLabShell : TCP 22
NGINX -> GitLabPages : TCP 8090
NGINX -> GitLabWorkhorse
GitLabShell -> Gitaly
GitLabShell -> GitLabWorkhorse
GitLabWorkhorse -> Gitaly
GitLabWorkhorse -> Puma
GitLabWorkhorse -> Redis
Sidekiq -> PostgreSQL
Sidekiq -> Redis
Puma -> PostgreSQL
Puma -> Redis
Puma -> Gitaly
GitLabWorkhorse <- Gitaly
